LSA - Advertisiment
LSA (Link-State Advertisement) is a message used by OSPF routers to advertise their link-state information to other routers.
such router id, interface , cost ,sequence number
LSD - Database

LSDB (Link-State Database) is the database that stores all received LSAs, including information such as Router ID, metrics (costs), age, sequence numbers, and network topology details. OSPF uses the LSDB to calculate the best paths.

